    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a thrilling VR adventure where dinosaurs rule the land and skies. With stunning visuals and exciting gameplay, explore a prehistoric world across three unique modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter Mode:<br>Face action-packed levels where survival is your goal. Arm yourself with a sniper rifle, pistol, and shotgun to hunt down relentless dinosaurs. Manage your health as you battle waves of predators in this intense mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Mode:<br>Wander freely through a beautifully crafted Jurassic environment. Observe a variety of dinosaurs up close, marveling at their lifelike details and behaviors. This mode offers a peaceful escape for nature enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Mode:<br>Soar through the skies on the back of a majestic Pteranodon! Glide above the stunning landscape as your flying companion takes you on a breathtaking tour, showcasing dinosaurs in their natural habitat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Dinosaurs:<br>Encounter legendary creatures like the T-Rex, Spinosaurus, Triceratops, Brachiosaurus, Compsognathus, Oviraptor, Velociraptor, and the Pteranodon.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a thrilling VR adventure where dinosaurs rule the land and skies. With stunning visuals and exciting gameplay, explore a prehistoric world across three unique modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter Mode:<br>Face action-packed levels where survival is your goal. Arm yourself with a sniper rifle, pistol, and shotgun to hunt down relentless dinosaurs. Manage your health as you battle waves of predators in this intense mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Mode:<br>Wander freely through a beautifully crafted Jurassic environment. Observe a variety of dinosaurs up close, marveling at their lifelike details and behaviors. This mode offers a peaceful escape for nature enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Mode:<br>Soar through the skies on the back of a majestic Pteranodon! Glide above the stunning landscape as your flying companion takes you on a breathtaking tour, showcasing dinosaurs in their natural habitat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Dinosaurs:<br>Encounter legendary creatures like the T-Rex, Spinosaurus, Triceratops, Brachiosaurus, Compsognathus, Oviraptor, Velociraptor, and the Pteranodon.</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into a prehistoric world where danger lurks at every turn. Armed with powerful weapons, hunt massive dinosaurs in immersive VR environments. Face deadly predators, explore wild terrains, and test your survival skills. Do you have what it takes to be the ultimate hunter?",
